{"id":"47142c2c72e0fb46","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-oracle-tm.md","title":"Oracle Turing Machine","display":"df-oracle-tm — Oracle Turing Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-oracle-tm","aliases":["88-df-oracle-tm"],"display":"df-oracle-tm — Oracle Turing Machine","depends_on":["[[88-df-oracle-rules]]","[[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]","[[88-df-ce-indexing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-oracle-tm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-oracle-tm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-tm — Oracle Turing Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b80082f9a69a6b62\" href=\"?note=b80082f9a69a6b62\" title=\"88-df-oracle-rules\">88-df-oracle-rules</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8c35cc87b3063540\" href=\"?note=8c35cc87b3063540\" title=\"88-lem-oracle-enumeration\">88-lem-oracle-enumeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"63bffa02095213d3\" href=\"?note=63bffa02095213d3\" title=\"88-df-ce-indexing\">88-df-ce-indexing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为神谕，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为程序索引；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为候选神谕机对象。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_e\">\\(F_e\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b80082f9a69a6b62\" href=\"?note=b80082f9a69a6b62\" title=\"88-df-oracle-rules\">88-df-oracle-rules</a>；该谓词同时规定有效可枚举性、相容条件上的单值性与初段扩张单调性。</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8c35cc87b3063540\" href=\"?note=8c35cc87b3063540\" title=\"88-lem-oracle-enumeration\">88-lem-oracle-enumeration</a> 保证每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_e\">\\(F_e\\)</span> 合法、枚举一致有效且覆盖所有合法规则图。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_e^A\">\\(M_e^A\\)</span> 是下述定义性三元组记号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M,A)\\)</span> 是本文件定义的谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"63bffa02095213d3\" href=\"?note=63bffa02095213d3\" title=\"88-df-ce-indexing\">88-df-ce-indexing</a>，仅指普通编号的 c.e. 自然数集合，不充当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_e\">\\(F_e\\)</span> 的替代名称。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nM_e^A\\coloneqq\\langle e,A,F_e\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nM_e^A\\coloneqq\\langle e,A,F_e\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M,A)\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(M=\\langle e,A,F_e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F_e)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M,A)\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(M=\\langle e,A,F_e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F_e)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M_e^A,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M_e^A,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>沿用本册的 Turing functional 表示法，而不是把三元组冒充普通机器的八元组。普通机器的转移谓词不能直接作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_e^A\">\\(M_e^A\\)</span>；神谕运行由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a> 给出。</p>\n<p>现在每个自然数索引都表示一个确定的合法神谕机。规则集用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_e\">\\(F_e\\)</span> 表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 仅保留“c.e. 自然数集”的含义。最后一个断言是前述枚举引理的直接推论，不是额外假定存在一个尚未构造的全索引枚举。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-oracle-rules","status":"resolved","id":"b80082f9a69a6b62","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-oracle-rules]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-oracle-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"8c35cc87b3063540","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-indexing","status":"resolved","id":"63bffa02095213d3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-indexing]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-rules","status":"resolved","id":"b80082f9a69a6b62","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F_e$ 及 $\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F)$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]；该谓词同时规定有效可枚举性、相容条件上的单值性与初段扩张单调性。","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-oracle-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"8c35cc87b3063540","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"[[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]] 保证每个 $F_e$ 合法、枚举一致有效且覆盖所有合法规则图。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-indexing","status":"resolved","id":"63bffa02095213d3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W_e$ 见 [[88-df-ce-indexing]]，仅指普通编号的 c.e. 自然数集合，不充当 $F_e$ 的替代名称。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"baf8d9aebf7edfa1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"沿用本册的 Turing functional 表示法，而不是把三元组冒充普通机器的八元组。普通机器的转移谓词不能直接作用于 $M_e^A$；神谕运行由 [[88-df-oracle-computation]] 给出。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"F_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"F_e","display":false},{"tex":"M_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M,A)","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"F_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nM_e^A\\coloneqq\\langle e,A,F_e\\rangle","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M,A)\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(M=\\langle e,A,F_e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F_e)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M_e^A,A)","display":true},{"tex":"M_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"F_e","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false}],"bytes":1910,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf8d9aebf7edfa1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e,s,x,y\\in\\mathbb N$；$M_e^A$、$\\mathrm{OracleTM}$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-tm]]。"},{"id":"fd47604c237781fa","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M_e^A$、$\\mathrm{OracleTM}$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-tm]]；$\\varphi_e^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]。"},{"id":"2b6a4a081d493b4c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M_e^A$ (oracle machine with index $e$, see [[88-df-oracle-tm]])"},{"id":"ceb241b03d936136","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M_e^B,B)$ (indexed oracle machine, see [[88-df-oracle-tm]])"},{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-164","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"| 可接受程序编号 | $\\mathrm{AcceptNum}_k(\\Phi_k)$、$\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$ | [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]] | 任意同元数有效满编号均有总可计算翻译；与有效性区分 |\n| 可枚举集的索引 | $W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)$、$W_{e,s}$ | [[88-df-ce-indexing]] | 自然数集合及一致可判定的有限阶段近似 |\n| 神谕规则图 | $F_e$、$\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F)$ | [[88-df-oracle-rules]] | 一致有效、相容单值且对初段扩张封闭；不再复用 W_e |\n| 神谕机对象 | $M_e^A=\\langle e,A,F_e\\rangle$ | [[88-df-oracle-tm]] | 以 Turing functional 表示，不冒充普通 TM 八元组 |\n| 神谕有限阶段 | $\\varphi_{e,s}^A$ | [[88-df-oracle-computation]] | 已接纳有限规则的求值；只在神谕固定时对阶段递增 |\n| 有效直和 | $\\bigoplus_k A_k$、$A\\oplus B$ | [[88-df-effective-join]] | 使用 enc 的列编码；有效性修饰编码而非输入集合 |\n| 唯一描述 | $\\iota x\\,\\phi$ | [[88-df-iota-operator]] | 逐公式、变量及完整自由参数的定义模式；唯一性失败取固定默认对象 |\n| 记号次序 | $<_{\\mathcal O_{88}}$ | [[88-df-ordinal-notation]] | 正生成规则的最小传递关系，不等于全部序数值比较 |\n| 有限迭代跳跃 | $A^{(0)}=A$、$A^{(n+1)}=(A^{(n)})'$ | [[88-df-turing-jump]] | 有正式递归定义的有限层记号 |\n| 优先构造数据 | $\\mathrm{PriorityData}(D,(A_s))$ | [[88-df-priority-method]] | 可计算有限阶段、最小注意策略、保护界与初始化均被定型 |\n| 有限损伤与成功 | $\\mathrm{FiniteInjury}(R,I)$、$\\mathrm{SuccessfulPriority}((A_s),R,I)$ | [[88-df-priority-method]] | 有限初始化次数与最终并集满足要求是不同条件 |\n| 可数语言 | $\\mathrm{CountableLanguage}(S)$、$\\operatorname{card}_{\\mathrm{sig}}(S)$ | [[88-df-signature-size]] | 统计全部非逻辑符号，而不是签名编码元组的元素个数 |"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[88-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[88-df-classical-calculus.md]]\n[[88-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[88-df-compactness.md]]\n[[88-df-completeness.md]]\n[[88-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[88-df-consistent.md]]\n[[88-df-countable.md]]\n[[88-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[88-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[88-df-defined.md]]\n[[88-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-delta1-set.md]]\n[[88-df-derivation.md]]\n[[88-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-join.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-elementary-equivalence.md]]\n[[88-df-elementary-substructure.md]]\n[[88-df-encoding.md]]\n[[88-df-finite-extension.md]]\n[[88-df-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-df-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-free-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-function.md]]\n[[88-df-function-recursive.md]]\n[[88-df-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-godel-sentence.md]]\n[[88-df-halting-problem.md]]\n[[88-df-halting-set.md]]\n[[88-df-hyperarithmetical.md]]\n[[88-df-hyperarithmetical-def.md]]\n[[88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-incompleteness-theorems.md]]\n